  "content": "<div align=\"center\">\n<h3><b>Punchy - Shubba 图腾</b></h3>\n<span>使用<b>Punchy模型部件</b>，将不死图腾变身为时尚的3D Shubba。本材质包提供完整的3D模型与流畅的物品动画，在GUI、第一人称及第三人称视角中保持外观一致。</span>\n</div>\n<br>\n<div align=\"center\">\n<img alt=\"需要Punchy\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/35e17bcff24fe173bf6cdab93344da8318299293_0.webp\" width=\"20%\"/>\n</div>\n<br>\n<div align=\"center\">\n<img alt=\"图腾展示\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Q5s8pFzG/images/d80f747d11d46049ec96c8ff03be9bbdab18795d.gif\" width=\"100%\"/>\n</div>\n<div align=\"center\">\n<img alt=\"图腾展示\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d0725d2272ace762ecf8c2add6307fe497a2c768.gif\" width=\"100%\"/>\n</div>",
